# Semaphore with two competing processes and a shared resource

Jméno sítě:
    semaphore

Komentář:
    Two processes compete for a single shared resource via a semaphore.
    acquire grabs the resource, release gives it back.
    Demonstrates conflict resolution - only one process can hold at a time.

Vstupy:
    acquire
    release

Výstupy:
    granted
    freed

Proměnné:
    int holder = 0

Místa (počáteční tokeny, volitelně akce):
    FREE      (1) pos: 200,80  : { output("freed", 1); }
    HELD_P1   (0) pos: 80,280  : { output("granted", 1); }
    HELD_P2   (0) pos: 320,280 : { output("granted", 2); }

Přechody a jejich podmínky:
T_acquire_p1 pos: 80,180 :
    in:  FREE*1
    out: HELD_P1*1
    when: acquire [ atoi(valueof("acquire")) == 1 ]
    do: { holder = 1; }

T_acquire_p2 pos: 320,180 :
    in:  FREE*1
    out: HELD_P2*1
    when: acquire [ atoi(valueof("acquire")) == 2 ]
    do: { holder = 2; }

T_release_p1 pos: 80,380 :
    in:  HELD_P1*1
    out: FREE*1
    when: release [ atoi(valueof("release")) == 1 ]
    do: { holder = 0; }

T_release_p2 pos: 320,380 :
    in:  HELD_P2*1
    out: FREE*1
    when: release [ atoi(valueof("release")) == 2 ]
    do: { holder = 0; }
